> versions of ProbABEL show that it has been present also in earlier
> version. At first sight it seems to have something to do with using
> FileVector files as input and using the mmscore option, because the
> examples/example_mms.sh test script fails (on 64bit Linux, it passes on
> 32bit Linux). This was tested on Ubuntu 11.04 (64 and 32 bit) and Ubuntu
